  Update daemon and exit Codex?
  Use this CLI package v0.0.0 from /x/cli-build/bin/codex. The complete local package will be
  copied and pinned against automatic updates.
  The daemon will restart if needed. Active or queued work may be interrupted.
  Codex will exit and run the update in this terminal, then return to the shell. Relaunch Codex
  afterward.

